es After Sex", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "electropop": {"genre": "electropop", "country_code": "de", "country_name": "Germany", "summary": "Electropop is a type of electronic pop music which features crackly synthesizers prominently in the mix.   Electropop has become an increasingly common term for this music post-2000 whereas in earlier years, synthpop was probably the more common term for pop music using synthesizers.\n\nWhen Kraftwerk first appeared in the mid-1970's, their music was described as electronic body music (ebm) in Germany, Krautrock in England, and technopop in Japan.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Katy Perry", "streams": 265779, "best_position": 12}, {"artist": "Rihanna", "streams": 250806, "best_position": 61}, {"artist": "AD\u00c9LA", "streams": 138533, "best_position": 17}, {"artist": "Dua Lipa", "streams": 92340, "best_position": 59}, {"artist": "Taylor Swift", "streams": 86350, "best_position": 70}, {"artist": "Beyonc\u00e9", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Billie Eilish", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Britney Spears", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Calvin Harris", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Chappell Roan", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Charli xcx", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "David Guetta", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "hip-hop": {"genre": "hip-hop", "country_code": "de", "country_name": "Germany", "summary": "Hip-Hop, also spelled Hip Hop or HipHop is a rhythm focused popular music style, originating from New York in The 70s. The term rap is sometimes used synonymously with Hip-Hop music. Hip-hop arose when DJs began isolating the percussion break from funk or disco songs for audiences to dance to.\nIt is now seen as a worldwide and popular genre ranging from American Mainstream (e.g. Eminem, Lil Wayne) to British Underground (e.g. Wiley, EMC Junkie ect).", "url": n